SUMMARY:Moss Wall Designs Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Design a framed moss wall with preserved moss\, botanicals\, and air plants in this BYOB workshop. Unwind at the end of your day and join us for an intimate happy hour workshop with expert instruction. \n\nCreate a one-of-a-kind framed moss wall using preserved moss\, dried elements\, botanical accents\, and two air plants for added dimension and life. Our moss wall artist\, Laura Alvis\, will be on hand to help stylize your design and guide you through the process. You’ll leave with a unique\, finished piece ready to hang and enjoy. Please note this workshop may take up to two hours. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/moss-wall-designs-workshop/
LOCATION:Gallery Grow\, 320 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/IMG_0449.avif
END:VEVENT
