SUMMARY:Gelli Plate Printmaking: Grades 4-6 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to embrace the experimental charm of Gelli plate printmaking in this workshop for students in grades 4-6! Unleash your creativity as you learn how to use Gelli plates to create hauntingly beautiful prints. Join us as we experiment with textures\, foliage stencils\, and various color palettes. This is a studio based class with some guidance and lot’s of creative freedom. Expect to have individual work time and one-on-one guidance! Register today! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
