SUMMARY:Multi-Cultural Art Exploration: Grades 1-3 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:In this PCA&D workshop students in grades 1-3 will explore cultures and travel through art as we learn about a variety of traditions and crafts in the visual arts and crafts! Your child will create art inspired by cultures including Aboriginal art\, Navajo crafts\, and more using a variety of artistic media including watercolor resist\, 3D bead making\, and paper weaving. This is a studio based class with some guidance and lot’s of creative freedom. Expect to have individual work time and one-on-one guidance! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
