SUMMARY:Illustrating Stories: Grades 1-3 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun day of writing and illustrating stories! Children love to make their own books\, so in this workshop for grades 1-3 we will do just that! We will learn how to brainstorm ideas\, create a plan\, and illustrate our ideas. Themes will include\, narratives\, graphic novels\, comic strips and picture books. This is a studio based class with some guidance and lot’s of creative freedom. Register today! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
