SUMMARY:3D Rendering 101: Grades 7-10 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:If you’re child in grades 7-10 is looking to add 3D modeling to their artistic skillset\, look no further! In this course students will learn how to create a finished rendered 3D still life in Blender. This course is perfect for beginners looking to hone their skills and become more familiar with 3D modeling software. This is a studio based class with lots of guidance to start followed by one-on-one instruction. Expect to have creative freedom within the bounds of the assignment! Register today! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
